    "interpretation": "The frozen rule asks for one control -- the cluster_id/label permutation -- and requires >= 2 verdict flips. That is met on fr-bail-entretien, where COHERENCE_QUERY_LANG and COHERENCE_QUERY_TERM both flip. Non-vacuity is therefore proven against the binding frozen criterion."
  },
