  "conclusion": "Non-vacuity is proven against the frozen rule's own requirement, and the harness is demonstrably sensitive to coordinate corruption (PROJ_SPEARMAN/PROJ_KNN10 values move by large margins). The charter's second control is reported as UNSATISFIED-AS-WRITTEN with its mechanism, because PROJ_RANK cannot read coordinates. No bar, threshold or control was weakened to make this read as a pass; this record exists so the director can see the discrepancy rather than a convenient verdict.",
